# Private chat data — NEVER commit. This repo is public, and real WhatsApp
# exports contain other people's private messages. Test fixtures are small,
# synthetic .txt files under test/fixtures/ and are committed intentionally;
# real exports (.zip, the _chat.txt inside them) are not.
*.zip
